'''Goddess of Light Sirius''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]].

