==Trivia==
*Goddess of Light Sirius originates from the discontinued game [[GirlsMons]], and is the only unit from said game not to be obtained from the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] Gacha, not counting [[Undead Cat (Special Cat)|Undead Cat]].
**She is also the only Uber from GirlsMons that can be obtained from the [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum]] and [[Legend Capsules (Gacha Event)|Legend Capsules]].
*This unit shares names with the brightest visible star from Earth, [[wikipedia:Sirius|Sirius]]. The name is derived from the Greek word ''Seirios'' meaning 'glowing', which is fitting for a goddess of light. The Normal Form description in the English version makes another reference to the star Sirius, stating that this unit descended from the brightest of stars.
*The dog on her shield may represent [[wikipedia:Orion (mythology)|Orion]]'s dog, Sirius, from Greek mythology.
*All of the banners as well as original Japanese poster for the [[BUSTERFEST (Gacha Event)|BUSTERFEST]] event use an early design for Sirius' Normal Form, in which she had a somewhat different ponytail alongside a loincloth in place of the plate hanging from her breastplate.

